# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# RHI CLI 2.0.0 - portable ignore rules.
# Nothing here refers to a specific machine, user or absolute path: every rule
# matches a file type or a folder that a build or an editor creates anywhere.
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------

# --- Windows and editor junk ---
Thumbs.db
ehthumbs.db
desktop.ini
.DS_Store

# --- Visual Studio, MSBuild, .NET SDK ---
.vs/
bin/
obj/
artifacts/
TestResults/
*.user
*.suo
*.userprefs
*.cache
*.nupkg
*.snupkg
*.binlog
*.tlog
*.log
project.lock.json

# --- JetBrains Rider / other IDEs ---
.idea/
*.sln.iml

# --- Addon build outputs (only under LiveAddon) ---
# The shipped rhi-live.addon32 / .addon64 are committed on purpose.
LiveAddon/*.pdb
LiveAddon/*.ilk
LiveAddon/*.exp
LiveAddon/*.lib
LiveAddon/*.obj
!LiveAddon/rhi-live.addon32
!LiveAddon/rhi-live.addon64

# --- Upstream project rules (kept so a fork behaves exactly as before) ---
Logs
Luma
OPTI/
downloads_tidyup.md
tools/*.md
tools/RHI-Stats/out
tools/RHI-Stats/out-small
tools/RenoDXdb-Editor/publish/
tools/PCGW-Editor/publish/
tools/pcgw-fetch/__pycache__/
tools/pcgw-fetch/*.pyc
__pycache__/
*.pyc
pcgw.md
nexusmods.md
nexusreport.md
todo.md
nvidiaProfileInspector-master/
OptiScaler-DLSSNR-v*/
docs/RenoDXdb*.json
docs/handover-*.md
docs/v2.3.3-test-checklist.md
docs/ui-freeze-audit-report.md
docs/ui-freeze-fix-tasks.md
docs/ui-polish-fix-tasks.md
.claude/settings.local.json
reports/
research_notes/

